    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 549 of the laws of 2005 amending the tax law relating\nto authorizing the county of Herkimer to impose a county recording tax on\nobligation secured by a mortgage on real property, in relation to the\nexpiration thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S7668",
